cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use this patch, cite godot-sandbox.
title: godot-sandbox (patches carried by this repository)
abstract: >-
  Changes this repository needs in V-Sekai-fire/godot-sandbox, kept here as
  git format-patch files instead of commits pushed to the fork (AGENTS.md
  rule 1). Each applies with `git am` to the commit named below.
  0001-bintr-emit.patch: GODOT_SANDBOX_BINTR_EMIT=<dir> makes the Sandbox
  write each loaded program's native translation as C99 in the shared-library
  form the bintr-<HASH> cache loads (libriscv's result_shared_c99), so
  tools/build.exs can bake project/bintr/. The Linux addon in
  project/addons/godot_sandbox/bin is built from the base plus this patch
  (its CITATION.cff has the sha256).
authors:
  - name: Alf-André Walla (fwsGonzo)
  - name: V-Sekai-fire
repository-code: https://github.com/V-Sekai-fire/godot-sandbox
commit: b1118e538222332bebeb695cd755c2f0b726b7f6
